OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry around Inverness and
OL,6,Fthe east with bright spells, feeling
OL,7,Fpleasant in any sunshine. Cloudy in
OL,8,Fthe west with outbreaks of rain, then
OL,9,Frain occasionally heavy and persistent
OL,10,Fover Skye and the western Highlands.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe rain pushing east during
OL,13,Fthis evening, turning light and
OL,14,Fpatchy. Mainly dry with clear spells
OL,15,Fovernight with a touch of frost
OL,16,Fpossible, although a few showers in
OL,17,Fthe west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
