OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FIt will be a bright day with a
OL,6,Fscattering of showers, the showers
OL,7,Fmainly dying out later. Light
OL,8,Fnorthwesterly winds.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FIt
OL,11,Fwill be mainly dry and settled as high
OL,12,Fpressure dominates. Chilly nights if
OL,13,Fskies remain clear with a frost
OL,14,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
